          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A Double-Barrel Shotgun can accept one each of the following mods:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Receiver:</strong> </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6BSZSiI20H86MtAb]{Hardened Receiver},&nbsp; @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.pNv4YuXn6LxkcLnj]{Hair Trigger},&nbsp; @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.7EV6l9KqHJ6KJpQi]{Powerful Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.hXHvlCvphIQ8x4be]{Advanced Receiver}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.X0puCM01tdYXaMSF]{Sawed-off Barrel}&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.ryaBZCITyZP3DoOP]{Full Stock}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.WZAnlfreDNUAaX4Y]{Reflex Sight}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Muzzle:</strong></span><span class=\"fontstyle0\"> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.G8G71ZleOMUrMWSK]{Muzzle Brake}</span></p>"
        }
